長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"文武両道で、卑怯な振る舞いを嫌い、目上を敬い、配下には優しくも厳しい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"私生活は質素で贅沢を嫌うストイックなものだが、実は少女趣味で、可愛いものが好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の長である理緒と、娘の真優を心から尊敬しており、彼女たちに忠誠を捧げており、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園都市の治安と風紀を守る委員の長として活動している。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"110750"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/73/73208a254f8070eba76fe0844be753ba7d1533c55eef749763697201e16b1fcd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ae/ae9adf0016b0adfba256d91195e1b26e6ea63fd0b2949883ba03e0bf106d52a3.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"榎木実佳","creatorId":"vndb:s987","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s987","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s987","name":"榎木 実佳","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:223820:110750:10026:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c55241","characterName":"赤井 麗","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"110751","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"223820"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13664"],"vndbCharacterId":"c55241"},"originalCharacterName":"赤井 麗","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A prankster and beautiful gal. She well known in the school, and serves as a pseudo-idol. She is not afraid to says what she thinks, and is compassionate to the people she likes. She often clashes with Tomoka due to their differing attitude. She hates the protagonist for not being a handsome man. Once he taken over the city, she tries to coerce him but..."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c55241"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"人懐っこくイタズラ好きな美人ギャル。"},{"spoil